# 1. Differentiating the Launch Source
  To accurately measure sessions, I need to know where the session started. 
  * App Installed: A user launching your PWA from an app icon on their home screen 
  * Browser: Opening it via a browser tab.

# User Session
  * Number of Active Users
  - Active users are tracked through Visibility-Driven Session Tracking. To be considered as Active User -> Yaya Gemma tab must be actively visible to the human eye. Block any user session analytics start until this state is 'visible'.
  * Time spent 
  - Total Time the user is active per session.
  * Avg Session per Active users
